OL,3,GNEWSAToddler heads to US for cancer
OL,4,Atreatment as family given 'glimmer of
OL,5,Ahope'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mother who is preparing to take her
OL,8,Fthree-year-old son to the US for a
OL,9,Fvaccine trial says it has given her
OL,10,Ffamily a "glimmer of hope" for his
OL,11,Ffuture.
OL,13,FAlmost a year ago, doctors warned Teddy
OL,14,FSloman's parents that he might not
OL,15,Fsurvive life-saving surgery after being
OL,16,Fdiagnosed with high-risk neuroblastoma,
OL,17,Fa rare, aggressive childhood cancer.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
